...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit 화면 { class: ours }
seq: 순서 함수 { class: ours }
finder: 매물 찾기 { class: ours }
firecrawl: Firecrawl API { class: ext }

user -> ui: 키 · 도시 · 조건, 버튼
ui -> ui: update_progress(0.1, Initializing)
ui -> seq: run_sequential_analysis(...)
seq -> ui: update_callback(0.2, Searching properties)
seq -> finder: find_properties_direct(...)
finder -> firecrawl: extract(urls, prompt, schema)
firecrawl -> finder: ExtractResponse (data.properties)
finder -> seq: "{success, properties}"
seq -> ui: update_callback(0.4, Properties found)
